OL,3,GNEWSAFire safety work still pending    
OL,4,Athree years on                         
OL,6,FSH said residents' safety was its      
OL,7,F"highest priority" and it remained     
OL,8,Fcommitted to completing any remediation
OL,9,Fwork required at Humphreys House.      
